</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/52340e38-9703-11f1-b9f5-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3657.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/52340e38-9703-11f1-b9f5-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3657.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">ebf01656-9ed9-11f1-92e5-f34066d658a1</guid><pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 11:23:53 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/52340e38-9703-11f1-b9f5-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-3657.jpg">© 网络图片</source><dc:creator>法广</dc:creator></item><item><category>政治</category><title>中国机器人百米跑仅用时9秒39，超越博尔特世界纪录</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB/20260823-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%99%BE%E7%B1%B3%E8%B7%91%E4%BB%85%E7%94%A8%E6%97%B69%E7%A7%9239%EF%BC%8C%E8%B6%85%E8%B6%8A%E5%8D%9A%E5%B0%94%E7%89%B9%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95</link><description>
